---
import DevPage from '../../layouts/DevPage.astro';
import { FeedbackLab } from './_feedback-lab/FeedbackLab';

/*
 * The feedback section prototyped (docs/research/feedback-1.md): two ways a visitor could reach us
 * from the About page, side by side, built light on the real components for Sean to try. Retired
 * by CLAUDE.md's recipe once the section ships.
 */
---

<DevPage title="feedback lab" description="Try the ways a visitor could send feedback.">
  <Fragment slot="intro">
    Feedback lab. Two ways a visitor could reach us from the About page: a form whose Send opens
    their email app with the message filled in, and the address alone. Try each; what the form
    composes shows under it, so nothing need be sent to see it. Neither stores anything here. The
    address is the one planned and does not exist yet.
  </Fragment>
  <FeedbackLab client:load />
</DevPage>
